# 📊 AI Budget Clustering

An end-to-end Machine Learning application that uses **K-Means Clustering** and **Principal Component Analysis (PCA)** to analyze and classify countries according to their government budget allocation patterns.

The project uses country-level budget allocation percentages across major sectors to identify countries with similar spending patterns. The trained Machine Learning model is integrated into an interactive **Streamlit web application** where users can select a country, predict its budget cluster, explore its budget allocation profile, and visualize clustering patterns through an interactive PCA visualization.

## 🚀 Live Application

🔗 **Try the AI Budget Clustering App:**  
