    ├── feature_columns.pkl
    │
    ├── requirements.txt
    │
    └── README.md

### `app.py`

The main Streamlit application containing the user interface, prediction functionality, data visualizations, and PCA visualization.

### `BudgetClusterAI.ipynb`

The Machine Learning development notebook containing the data preparation, feature selection, clustering analysis, model training, cluster interpretation, and PCA workflow.

### `country_budget_profiles.csv`

The country-level budget allocation dataset used by the application.

### `.pkl` Files

Saved Machine Learning objects required for prediction, preprocessing, cluster interpretation, and PCA visualization.

### `requirements.txt`

Contains the Python dependencies required to run the application.

## ▶️ Run the Application Locally

To run the application on your computer:

### 1. Clone the repository

    git clone https://github.com/Saima-Naseem/Machine-Learning-Apps.git

### 2. Open the project folder

    cd Machine-Learning-Apps/AI-Budget-Clustering

### 3. Install the required dependencies

    pip install -r requirements.txt

### 4. Run the Streamlit application

    streamlit run app.py

The application will then open in your web browser.

