## ⚠️ Disclaimer

The clusters generated by this application are based solely on patterns identified in the available budget allocation data.

Cluster names such as "Defense Priority" or "Human Development" are descriptive interpretations created to make the Machine Learning results easier to understand. They do not represent official government classifications or policy judgments.

The application is intended for educational, analytical, and exploratory purposes.

